X:1
T:What A Friend We Have In Jesus
T:UNTITLED
C:Music: Charles C. Converse, 1868 · Words: Joseph M. Scriven, 1855
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Book of hymns and tunes", 1874 (Presbyterian USA) Hymn 369. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/converse_converse): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
